==Battleground==
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 6~6.67 seconds<sup>180f~200f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 8~9.33 seconds<sup>240f~280f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 8~9.33 seconds<sup>240f~280f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 1.67~2.33 seconds<sup>50f~70f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because the Master A. and Teacher Bear take so long to spawn, this stage can easily be rushed with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and other fast rushers like [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Cats in a Box]].

